 {r}←{enforceCompile}Selfie parms
⍝ `parms` must either be a parameter space or an empty vector (`⍬`).
 enforceCompile←{0<⎕NC ⍵:⍎⍵ ⋄ 0}'enforceCompile'
 :If 0=≢parms
     parms←##.APLGUI.Laguntza.CreateParms''
     parms.folderName←'expand'##.APLGUI.FilesAndDirs.NormalizePath'Help\'
     parms.helpAbout←'APL GUI Utilities' 'Written by Kai Jaeger'
     parms.helpCaption←'APLGUI'
     parms.helpVersion←1⊃##.APLGUI.Version
     parms.helpVersionDate←2⊃##.APLGUI.Version
     :If 0=##.APLGUI.FilesAndDirs.IsDir parms.folderName
         ⍝ Huuh?!
     :EndIf
     parms.source←⍎(⍕##),'.APLGUI_Help'
 :EndIf
 r←enforceCompile ##.APLGUI.Laguntza.New parms
⍝Done
